<title>FRANCE: Suez half-year turnover up slightly.</title>
<headline>Suez half-year turnover up slightly.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					45,957    vs   45,473</p>
<p>	- includes Indosuez		     17,778    vs   17,981</p>
<p>	    Credisuez				2,926    vs    2,722</p>
<p>	    Specialised financial units     10,671    vs    8,877</p>
<p>	    Societe Generale de Belgique    14,068    vs   15,511</p>
<p>	    Cie de Suez and others		 514    vs	382</p>
<p>NOTE - Compagnie de Suez reported its half-year turnover in the official bulletin BALO.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
